        "fold1": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who it’s for",
            "text": "<p><strong>Made for adults in their 40s, 50s and 60s.</strong> Most of our customers are in their 40s and 50s. You don’t need to be sporty or own a smartwatch.</p><p>It’s for you if afternoons feel harder than they used to, you get less back from the same effort, or you want to keep up with work, family and the things you love.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fold2": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What it does",
            "text": "<p>Five jobs in one daily formula:</p><ul><li><strong>Energy.</strong> Vitamins B6 and B12 contribute to the reduction of tiredness and fatigue.</li><li><strong>Recovery.</strong> Vitamin D contributes to normal muscle function.</li><li><strong>Stress.</strong> B vitamins contribute to normal psychological function, and B5 to normal mental performance.</li><li><strong>Longevity.</strong> 300mg NR, which your body turns into NAD+, plus zinc, which contributes to the protection of cells from oxidative stress.</li><li><strong>Immunity.</strong> Vitamin D, zinc, copper, folate, B6 and B12 contribute to the normal function of the immune system.</li></ul><p>One jar instead of five pots: no separate NAD+, CoQ10, resveratrol, D3 + K2 or B-complex.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fold3": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What’s inside",
            "text": "<p>19 ingredients in two capsules. Every dose is on the label, per two-capsule serving:</p><ul><li><strong>TMG (trimethylglycine)</strong> 450mg</li><li><strong>NR (nicotinamide riboside)</strong> 300mg</li><li><strong>Grape seed extract</strong> 150mg · 120:1 extract, 95% polyphenols, 142.5mg</li><li><strong>CoQ10</strong> 150mg · ubiquinone</li><li><strong>Zinc</strong> 15mg · zinc bisglycinate</li><li><strong>Trans-resveratrol</strong> 50mg · from Japanese knotweed root, 95%</li><li><strong>Vitamin D3</strong> 50mcg (2,000 IU) · cholecalciferol, from algae</li><li><strong>PQQ</strong> 20mg · pyrroloquinoline quinone</li><li><strong>Vitamin B3</strong> 16mg · nicotinamide, no flush</li><li><strong>Vitamin B12</strong> 100mcg · methylcobalamin</li><li><strong>Vitamin B5</strong> 10mg · calcium D-pantothenate</li><li><strong>Copper</strong> 1mg · copper bisglycinate</li><li><strong>Vitamin K2</strong> 100mcg · menaquinone-7, MK-7</li><li><strong>Vitamin B6</strong> 5mg · pyridoxal-5′-phosphate, P5P</li><li><strong>Vitamin B2</strong> 5mg · riboflavin-5′-phosphate</li><li><strong>Vitamin B1</strong> 5mg · thiamine hydrochloride</li><li><strong>BioPerine® black pepper extract</strong> 5mg · 95% piperine, 4.75mg</li><li><strong>Folate</strong> 400mcg · L-5-methyltetrahydrofolate, 5-MTHF</li><li><strong>Biotin</strong> 300mcg · D-biotin</li></ul><p>Filter them by job on our <a href=\"/pages/ingredients\">ingredients page</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fold4": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to take it",
            "text": "<p>Two capsules every morning with breakfast.</p><p><strong>Why with food?</strong> CoQ10, vitamin D3 and K2 dissolve in fat, so your body takes them in best with a meal.</p><p><strong>Why every day?</strong> It works best as a habit. Keep the jar by the kettle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fold5": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Quality and testing",
            "text": "<ul><li>Every dose on the label, no proprietary blends</li><li>Only UK-authorised ingredients: that’s why we use NR, not NMN</li><li>Made in the UK to GMP standards</li><li>Every batch tested before release for heavy metals, microbes and capsule quality</li><li>Vegan capsules from plant cellulose, vitamin D3 from algae, no major allergens</li></ul><p><a href=\"#test-results\">See the results for the current batch</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "fold6": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Delivery, skipping and cancelling",
            "text": "<p>Free next-day delivery in the UK. A new jar arrives every 4 weeks, with gifts on your orders.</p><p>Skip, pause or cancel online anytime. No phone calls, and we remind you five days before every payment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fold7": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "90-day money-back promise",
            "text": "<p>Take it every day for 90 days. If you don’t feel the difference, email <a href=\"mailto:hello@mutolongevity.com\">hello@mutolongevity.com</a> and you get every subscription payment back.</p>"
          }
        },
