    "faq": {
      "type": "muto-crea-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who is MUTO for?",
            "text": "<p>Adults over 35. Most of our customers are in their 40s and 50s. You don’t need to be sporty or own a smartwatch.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is NAD+, and why does it matter?",
            "text": "<p>NAD+ is a molecule every cell uses to turn food into energy. Your body makes less of it from your mid-30s. MUTO gives you 300mg of NR, a form of vitamin B3 your body turns into NAD+.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why NR and not NMN?",
            "text": "<p>NR is authorised for food supplements in the UK. NMN is still under assessment, so we don’t use it. 300mg of NR is the most allowed in Great Britain.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will I notice something?",
            "text": "<p>Give it 60 to 90 days. Many people notice their afternoons first, sometimes within a few weeks. For others it takes longer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I know it’s working?",
            "text": "<p>Before you start, score your energy, sleep and recovery out of 10. Do it again at day 30 and day 90, then compare. A pen and paper is fine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it safe with my other medication?",
            "text": "<p>Usually, yes. Coffee is fine too. If you take medicine, ask your doctor first, especially if you take a blood thinner like warfarin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it vegan?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. The capsules are plant cellulose, vitamin D3 comes from algae, and there are no major allergens, fillers, caffeine or stimulants.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is it tested?",
            "text": "<p>Every batch is tested before release for heavy metals, microbes and capsule quality. <a href=\"#test-results\">See the results for the current batch</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q9": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I skip, pause or cancel?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, online, anytime. No phone calls. We send a reminder five days before every payment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q10": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if it’s not for me?",
            "text": "<p>Take it every day for 90 days. If you don’t feel the difference, email <a href=\"mailto:hello@mutolongevity.com\">hello@mutolongevity.com</a> and you get every subscription payment back.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
